{"description": "A general-purpose window upscaler for Windows 10/11.", "homepage": "", "topics": ["magnifier", "hlsl", "capture", "fsr", "anime4k", "cppwinrt", "super-resolution", "windows", "fluent-design", "xaml-islands", "magpie"], "pushed_at": "2026-11-11T10:41:50Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-11T20:06:03Z", "detail": {"avatar": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34770031?u=c0a7c8b66bce3463528bfbd305029cd1295210f9&v=4", "license": "GPL-3.0", "discussions_total": 177, "latest_release": {"name": "v0.13.0", "tag": "v0.13.0", "published_at": "2026-10-17T03:44:35Z", "body": "<details>\r\n<summary>中文版</summary>\r\n\r\n## 新功能\r\n\r\n1. 全屏模式缩放下存在黑边时支持更改输出画面位置 (#1306、#973)\r\n2. 添加截图快捷键，默认为 Alt+Shift+S (感谢 @freeze-dolphin) (#1436、#1288)\r\n3. 支持截图文件名自定义，支持使用窗口标题、时间等参数 (#1463、#1297)\r\n4. 支持在缩放时保持屏幕常亮 (#1455、#1444)\r\n5. 为配置文件的导航菜单添加了右键菜单来快捷启动和删除 (#1464)\r\n\r\n## 新效果\r\n\r\n1. SGSR (感谢 @hooke007) (#1266): 移植自 [Snapdragon Game Super Resolution v1](https://github.com/SnapdragonGameStudios/snapdragon-gsr/tree/main/sgsr/v1)，这个一个非常轻量级的 3D 画面缩放算法\r\n6. k7_modernAnime_FHD_x2 (感谢 @hooke007) (#1400): 适合动漫类风格的超分算法\r\n7. Ani4Kv2_ArtCNN_C4F32_i (感谢 @XIONGPEILIN) (#1415): 又一个动画风格超分算法，移植自 https://github.com/Sirosky/Upscale-Hub/releases/tag/Ani4K-v2\r\n\r\n## 修复\r\n\r\n1. 修复启动参数文本框无法键入空格的问题 (#1376、#1371)\r\n2. 优化了窗口模式缩放的可靠性 (#1335、#1356)\r\n3. 修复了 Win10 中的内存泄露 (#1355)\r\n4. 提高了保存配置文件的可靠性 (#1439)\r\n\r\n## 其他更改\r\n\r\n1. 更新翻译 (感谢翻译贡献者们！)\r\n6. 删除了已废弃的 CuNNy 族\r\n7. 优化可执行文件的版本号信息 (感谢 @Howard20181) (#1344)\r\n8. 优化了一些效果的性能\r\n\r\n## 面向开发者\r\n\r\n现在编译项目的要求如下：\r\n* Visual Studio 2026\r\n* Windows SDK 26100 的最新版本\r\n* Python 3.14\r\n* 不再需要安装 CMake\r\n \r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n\r\n1. Support changing the output alignment when there are black borders in fullscreen scaling (#1306, #973)\r\n2. Added a screenshot hotkey, defaulting to Alt+Shift+S (thanks @freeze-dolphin) (#1436, #1288)\r\n3. Added support for customizing screenshot filenames (#1463, #1297)\r\n4. Added an option to keep the display awake while scaling (#1455, #1444)\r\n5. Added a context menu to the profile navigation menu for quickly launching and deleting profiles (#1464)\r\n\r\n## New Effects\r\n\r\n1. SGSR (thanks @hooke007) (#1266): Ported from [Snapdragon Game Super Resolution v1](https://github.com/SnapdragonGameStudios/snapdragon-gsr/tree/main/sgsr/v1). A very lightweight upscaling algorithm designed for 3D content\r\n2. k7_modernAnime_FHD_x2 (thanks @hooke007) (#1400): An upscaling algorithm designed for anime-style content.\r\n3. Ani4Kv2_ArtCNN_C4F32_i (thanks @XIONGPEILIN) (#1415): Another anime-oriented upscaling algorithm, ported from https://github.com/Sirosky/Upscale-Hub/releases/tag/Ani4K-v2\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n\r\n1. Fixed an issue where spaces could not be entered in the `Launch parameters` text box (#1376, #1371)\r\n2. Improved the reliability of windowed mode scaling (#1335, #1356)\r\n3. Fixed a memory leak on Windows 10 (#1355)\r\n4. Improved the reliability of saving configuration file (#1439)\r\n\r\n## Other Changes\r\n\r\n1. Updated translations (thanks to all localization contributors!)\r\n2. Removed the deprecated CuNNy family of effects\r\n3. Improved executable version information (thanks @Howard20181) (#1344)\r\n4. Improved the performance of several effects\r\n\r\n## For developers\r\n\r\nThe requirements for building the project are now:\r\n\r\n* Visual Studio 2026\r\n* The latest version of Windows SDK 26100\r\n* Python 3.14\r\n* CMake is no longer required"}, "hot_issues": [{"number": 772, "title": "ONNX support | ONNX 支持", "comments": 73, "created_at": "2023-12-08T04:57:06Z"}, {"number": 278, "title": "Option to set resolution to scale", "comments": 45, "created_at": "2022-01-17T11:58:38Z"}, {"number": 1367, "title": "Borderless Gaming Copyright Violation", "comments": 44, "created_at": "2026-01-25T22:24:29Z"}, {"number": 560, "title": "Add Nvidia Maxine AI Video Upscaler (RTX Video Super Resolution)", "comments": 18, "created_at": "2023-04-10T15:36:31Z"}, {"number": 1319, "title": "非遊戲使用撥放掉幀", "comments": 17, "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:23:57Z"}, {"number": 141, "title": "Streaming Issues 串流问题", "comments": 17, "created_at": "2021-09-14T01:31:50Z"}, {"number": 137, "title": "G-sync\\VRR support", "comments": 14, "created_at": "2021-09-12T16:45:51Z"}, {"number": 55, "title": "HDR support", "comments": 14, "created_at": "2021-08-10T14:04:11Z"}], "discussions": [{"number": 1493, "title": "v0.14 Dev Channel", "comments": 1, "category": "Dev Channel", "created_at": "2026-10-17T04:00:17Z"}, {"number": 1492, "title": "v0.13.0", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-10-17T03:44:35Z"}, {"number": 1488, "title": "Featuring Magpie in Devs Helping Devs (Fri Oct 16, 9:47 AM ET)", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-10-16T01:27:11Z"}, {"number": 1479, "title": "v0.13.0-preview02", "comments": 0, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-10-01T11:40:41Z"}, {"number": 1475, "title": "v0.13.0-preview01", "comments": 1, "category": "Announcements", "created_at": "2026-10-01T06:21:49Z"}, {"number": 1462, "title": "add alternating frames of dlss cost scaler", "comments": 0, "category": "Dev Channel", "created_at": "2026-09-14T11:16:09Z"}, {"number": 1453, "title": "发错地方了", "comments": 0, "category": "General", "created_at": "2026-09-04T16:20:48Z"}, {"number": 1445, "title": "没有找到DLSS Super Resolution的效果选项", "comments": 0, "category": "Q&A", "created_at": "2026-08-30T07:46:31Z"}], "readme": "<br>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"./src/Magpie/Icons/SVG/Magpie Icon Full Disabled.svg\" width=\"150px\" height=\"150px\" alt=\"Logo\">\n</p>\n<h1 align=\"center\">Magpie</h1>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n[![License](https://img.shields.io/github/license/Blinue/Magpie)](./LICENSE)\n[![build](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/actions/workflows/build.yml)\n[![All Contributors](https://img.shields.io/github/all-contributors/Blinue/Magpie)](#acknowledgement-)\n[![Translation status](https://hosted.weblate.org/widget/magpie/svg-badge.svg)](https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/magpie)\n\n</div>\n\n🌍 **English** | [简体中文](./README_ZH.md)\n\nMagpie is a lightweight window upscaling tool that comes equipped with a variety of efficient scaling algorithms and filters.\n\n👉 [Download](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/releases)\n\n👉 [FAQ](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/wiki/FAQ%20(EN))\n\n👉 [Built-in effects](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/wiki/Built-in%20effects)\n\n👉 [Compilation guide](https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/wiki/Compilation%20guide)\n\n## Features\n\n* Supports both fullscreen and windowed scaling\n* Includes a variety of built-in algorithms and filters, including [Anime4K](https://github.com/bloc97/Anime4K), [FSR](https://github.com/GPUOpen-Effects/FidelityFX-FSR), CRT shaders, and more\n* WinUI-based user interface with support for light and dark themes\n* Multi-monitor support\n\n## Screenshots\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px;\">\n  <img src=\"img/main-window.png\" alt= \"Main window\" height=\"300\">\n  <img src=\"img/screenshot.png\" alt= \"Main window\" height=\"300\">\n</div>\n\n## Hints\n\n1. If you have set DPI scaling and the window you want to scale does not support high DPI (which is common in older games), it is recommended to first enter the program's compatibility settings and set \"High DPI scaling override\" to \"Application\".\n\n2. Some games support zooming the window, but with extremely naive algorithms. Please set the resolution to the built-in (best) option.\n\n## System requirements\n\n1. Windows 10 v1903+ or Windows 11\n2. DirectX feature level 11\n\n## Localization\n\nThanks to [Weblate](https://weblate.org) for hosting! Click the image below to visit the translation page.\n\n[![Translation status](https://hosted.weblate.org/widget/magpie/multi-auto.svg)](https://hosted.weblate.org/engage/magpie)\n\n## Acknowledgement\n\nThanks go to these wonderful people:\n\n<!-- ALL-CONTRIBUTORS-LIST:START - Do not remove or modify this section -->\n<!-- prettier-ignore-start -->\n<!-- markdownlint-disable -->\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.28%\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Blinue\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34770031?v=4?s=100\" width=\"100px;\" alt=\"Xu\"/><br /><sub><b>Xu</b></sub></a><br /><a href=\"#maintenance-Blinue\" title=\"Maintenance\">🚧</a></td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.28%\"><a href=\"https://github.com/hooke007\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41094733?v=4?s=100\" width=\"100px;\" alt=\"hooke007\"/><br /><sub><b>hooke007</b></sub></a><br /><a href=\"https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/commits?author=hooke007\" title=\"Documentation\">📖</a> <a href=\"#question-hooke007\" title=\"Answering Questions\">💬</a> <a href=\"#userTesting-hooke007\" title=\"User Testing\">📓</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/commits?author=hooke007\" title=\"Code\">💻</a></td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.28%\"><a href=\"http://palxex.ys168.com\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58222?v=4?s=100\" width=\"100px;\" alt=\"Pal Lockheart\"/><br /><sub><b>Pal Lockheart</b></sub></a><br /><a href=\"#userTesting-palxex\" title=\"User Testing\">📓</a></td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.28%\"><a href=\"https://www.stevedonaghy.com/\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1029699?v=4?s=100\" width=\"100px;\" alt=\"Steve Donaghy\"/><br /><sub><b>Steve Donaghy</b></sub></a><br /><a href=\"https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/commits?author=neoKushan\" title=\"Code\">💻</a> <a href=\"#translation-neoKushan\" title=\"Translation\">🌍</a></td>\n      <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" width=\"14.28%\"><a href=\"http://gyrojeff.top\"><img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30655701?v=4?s=100\" width=\"100px;\" alt